			"originalText": "Advantages\nEasy to understand\nSmall IDs\nNaturally ordered\nWorks well for small systems\n\nProblems\n\nEvery write depends on one database or counter.\nIt can become a bottleneck.\nIt can become a single point of failure.\nIt becomes difficult when data is split across many databases.",
