			"updated": 1786368588150,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Advantage\n\nEach shard can generate IDs locally.\n\nProblems\n\nThe shard number must be managed.\nIDs may expose the shard structure.\nAdding or removing shards becomes more complicated.\nIDs may not follow global time order.",
